  "description": "A contract relationship with the wrong man, all because of a mistaken confession.\n\nShe only trusted him because he said he would help her win over her crush,\nbut if this is supposed to be dating coaching, then what exactly is with all this physical affection?\n\nJieun’s heart keeps wavering at these unfamiliar feelings of excitement she has never experienced before.\n\nBut this feeling can’t possibly be love.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \nChapters: [Naver Novel](https://novel.naver.com/webnovel/list?novelId=765195), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=3712741)   \nVolumes: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=10970220) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70533082/), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14738615), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1180016345)",
